# Welcome to the Next.js Frontend Service

This service provides a modern Next.js 16 frontend application with:

- **App Router** — file-based routing with layouts and server components
- **TypeScript** — full type safety
- **Tailwind CSS v4** — utility-first CSS with the latest engine
- **Server Components** — React Server Components by default
- **Hot-reload** — instant feedback during development via codefly watcher
- **Application workspaces** — explicit packages below `code/packages/*`

The agent owns the Next.js substrate only. Application plugin contracts and
composition remain application-owned; no package is discovered or registered
by side effect.

## Development

```bash
codefly run
```

The runtime allows two execution-profile-aware startup defaults: development
waits up to two minutes for a cold first-route compilation, while production
waits 30 seconds after its immutable build. Exceptionally large applications
can override either deadline in `service.codefly.yaml`:

```yaml
spec:
  readiness-timeout: 3m
```

The value must be a positive duration no greater than ten minutes.

## Build

The service builds as a standalone Docker image for production deployment.
